{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brains. Battles. Breakthroughs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission: Outthink, Outsolve, and Outsmart.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where your sharpest weapon isn\u2019t a sword\u2014it\u2019s your mind. Travel through mysterious realms, crack ancient codes, outwit quirky rivals, and face off in real-time battles where strategy matters more than speed. Every quest is packed with hidden secrets, twisted puzzles, and real risks on this enchanted island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll collect rare items, unlock new areas, and level up your skills\u2014not just in the game, but in real life. Because here\u2019s the twist: to win, you\u2019ll need to use the same tools real-world problem-solvers rely on\u2014like analyzing data, spotting patterns, and thinking critically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed especially for middle and high schoolers, this game-based learning adventure turns statistics into a superpower. No boring lectures. No pop quizzes. Just immersive storylines, brain-boosting gameplay, and battles that demand both logic and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing to learn or just love a smart challenge, this game delivers strategy, storytelling, and action\u2014all in one unforgettable quest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat meets critical thinking</strong> in fast-paced, real-time encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-based missions</strong> filled with puzzles, traps, and decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse worlds</strong> with hidden areas, collectible gear, and side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-world math and data skills</strong> seamlessly integrated into gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements, upgrades, and unlockable story paths</strong> that reward exploration and problem-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtual reality components (coming soon!)</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shipwrecked Scholar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3572930/1add1c933483a5e3b36e0c1e75c5ad9b3e83ee9c.jpg"},{"name":"Counsel of Nuri","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3572930/82c91e9476a0941b0e177a80ef53fe19385c2a52.jpg"},{"name":"Blessing of Lysara","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3572930/b06f4234e3d13c7e0e203c8c548a930967d014db.jpg"},{"name":"Troll Toll, Settled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3572930/084bd9642cebfcf00cb3d0a1e5aa1d8ac1828923.jpg"},{"name":"First Descent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3572930/5f1f520088c05062c5b45827d35b119a4f58fd41.jpg"},{"name":"Melody, Mended","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3572930/9b8c1b6bfd1e6a9f04169a1db4b18296d1a258cd.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572930?t=1759004343","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572930/c1de878049948775da009d473787a1477ff94117/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759004343","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572930/174239a0f27b8a05637fad19d1fe4f2072ef4297/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759004343","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572930/174239a0f27b8a05637fad19d1fe4f2072ef4297/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759004343","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id